<!-- ═══════ ABOUT ═══════ -->
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">01 — About</div>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Building ML systems<br>that <em>actually ship</em></h2>
  <div class="bento">
    <div class="card span-8 reveal">
      <div class="card-label">Bio</div>
      <p>
        I'm an ML engineer who bridges the gap between research papers and production systems. At Adobe, I lead ML engineering focused on building and deploying intelligent NLP systems at scale. Previously, I was an Engineering Manager at Yellow.ai, where I designed next-generation conversational AI infrastructure handling thousands of models across multilingual contexts.
      </p>
      <br>
      <p>
        I've authored two published books on machine learning — one on ML with Rust (Apress) and another on Facebook's fastText library (Packt). I regularly write deep technical articles on LLMs, attention mechanisms, quantization, and ML system design.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card span-4 photo-card reveal">
      <div class="avatar-placeholder">JB</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card span-4 reveal">
      <div class="card-label">Focus Areas</div>
      <div class="tags-wrap">
        <span class="tag">LLM Systems</span>
        <span class="tag">NLP at Scale</span>
        <span class="tag">Flash Attention</span>
        <span class="tag">Model Quantization</span>
        <span class="tag">Diffusion Models</span>
        <span class="tag">ML System Design</span>
        <span class="tag">Conversational AI</span>
        <span class="tag">MLOps</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card span-4 reveal">
      <div class="card-label">Currently</div>
      <p>
        Leading ML engineering at Adobe. Writing about Flash Attention internals, LLM quantization techniques (GGUF, GPTQ, AWQ, BitNet), and production ML systems design.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card span-4 reveal">
      <div class="card-label">Quick Stats</div>
      <div class="stat-rows">
        <div class="stat-row"><span class="lbl">Location</span><span class="val">Bengaluru, India</span></div>
